ancers", "source_kind": "regulator", "seen_in": [{"source_name": "Council for Licensed Conveyancers", "url": "https://clc-uk.org/visual-composer-20281"}], "category": "risk-compliance", "region": "uk", "market": "UK", "language": "en", "kind": "regulatory", "paywall": false, "ltme_summary": "The Council for Licensed Conveyancers has published its Risk Agenda 2026, which says continuing problems with post-completion work are an ethical as well as a process failure. It points to the quality of applications sent to HM Land Registry and the number of requisitions the registry returns. The regulator frames the issue as one for conveyancers' professional conduct.", "hook": "Council for Licensed Conveyancers says post-completion errors are an ethical failure, not just a process one", "entities": ["Council for Licensed Conveyancers", "HM Land Registry"], "jurisdiction": "England and Wales", "amount": null, "provenance": "confirmed", "status": "live"}, {"id": "LN-20261023-026", "cluster_id": "LN-20261023-026", "register_day": "2026-10-23", "first_seen": "2026-10-22T15:48:20+00:00", "published_at": "2026-10-22T14:41:20+00:00", "title": "PHP Patch – Take Action", "url": "https://clc-uk.org/visual-composer-20278", "domain": "clc-uk.org", "source_name": "Council for Licensed Conveyancers", "source_kind": "regulator", "seen_in": [{"source_name": "Council for Licensed Conveyancers", "url": "https://clc-uk.org/visual-composer-20278"}], "category": "security-infrastructure", "region": "uk", "market": "UK", "language": "en", "kind": "regulatory", "paywall": false, "ltme_summary": "The Council for Licensed Conveyancers has issued guidance urging members to act on a critical PHP security update. The vulnerability could let attackers run commands on affected web servers. The regulator notes that PHP is widely used and may be built into other software, so firms should check their systems.", "hook": "Council for Licensed Conveyancers urges firms to act on a critical PHP vulnerability patc